WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Earth layers • composition versus behavior
Composition and mechanical behavior describe different boundaries. The lithosphere includes crust and uppermost mantle.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Isostasy • thicker crust rides higher
Adding thickness at equal density raises the top and deepens the root.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Isostasy • denser material rides lower
At equal thickness, the denser block sinks farther and its top sits lower.
